# Check every text file out with LF on all platforms. Git on Windows defaults to
# core.autocrlf=true, which rewrites the working copy to CRLF; Prettier is
# configured for LF, so format:check on the Windows CI runner reported all 158
# tracked files as misformatted. The repository itself already stores LF, so
# this changes nothing on checkout for Linux or macOS.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Icons must never be line-ending converted.
*.ico binary
*.png binary
*.icns binary
